state Manuscript Review
active-tag Stage

tag Stage as s
  Intake blue
  Review purple
  Decision orange
  Archive gray

tag Owner as o
  Author green
  Editor teal
  Board red

[*] -> Submitted

Submitted s: Intake, o: Author
  -assign-> Screening

Screening s: Intake, o: Editor
  -desk reject-> Rejected
  -pass-> Peer Review

Peer Review s: Review, o: Board
  -revisions-> Revising
  -accept-> Accepted
  -reject-> Rejected

Revising s: Review, o: Author
  -resubmit-> Peer Review

Accepted s: Decision, o: Editor
  -publish-> Published

Rejected s: Decision, o: Editor

Published s: Archive, o: Editor

Published -> [*]
Rejected -> [*]
